{"issue": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1467", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1467/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1467/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1467/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1467", "id": 923522695, "node_id": "MDU6SXNzdWU5MjM1MjI2OTU=", "number": 1467, "title": "Mavsdk instances should not share mavlink_status_t", "user": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [{"id": 629977267, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWw2Mjk5NzcyNjc=", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/labels/bug", "name": "bug", "color": "ee0701", "default": true, "description": null}], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 2, "created_at": "2021-06-17T06:40:17Z", "updated_at": "2023-12-27T03:15:54Z", "closed_at": "2023-12-27T03:15:54Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "sub_issues_summary": {"total": 0, "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "It turns out that `Mavsdk` instances will share `mavlink_status_t` if they are in the same compilation unit. This happens for instance when two `Mavsdk` instances are created in an integration test to talk to each other. In this case, they will access the same `mavlink_status_t` which is allocated `static`, so they will share the `seq` field.\r\n\r\nThe `static` status comes from here:\r\nhttps://github.com/mavlink/c_library_v2/blob/636fae5ca34eff6007344718755d78fcdf94238e/mavlink_helpers.h#L29\r\n\r\nThe solutions I see are:\r\n1. Use `_pack_chan()` everywhere, instead of `_pack()`. This would require all plugin code to be changed and also would require the Mavsdk instance to detect other Mavsdk instances using some sort of global data structure. Both things I would like to avoid.\r\n2. Try to allocate the status in `Mavsdk` and use the `MAVLINK_EXTERNAL_RX_STATUS` define: https://github.com/mavlink/c_library_v2/blob/636fae5ca34eff6007344718755d78fcdf94238e/mavlink_helpers.h#L25 I'm not entirely sure how the mapping would work though.\r\n3. Check the MAVLink C++ library to see if it handles it differently.\r\n\r\nThis can be observed in the Ftp integration test, e.g.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncmake --build build/default -j8 && MAVSDK_MESSAGE_DEBUGGING=1 build/default/src/integration_tests/integration_tests_runner --gtest_filter=\"FtpTest.TestServer\"\r\n...\r\nNote: Google Test filter = FtpTest.TestServer\r\n[==========] Running 1 test from 1 test suite.\r\n[----------] Global test environment set-up.\r\n[----------] 1 test from FtpTest\r\n[ RUN      ] FtpTest.TestServer\r\n[08:23:30|Info ] MAVSDK version: v0.40.0-60-gf24ba9de (mavsdk_impl.cpp:21)\r\n[08:23:30|Debug] Message debugging is on. (mavsdk_impl.cpp:32)\r\n[08:23:30|Info ] MAVSDK version: v0.40.0-60-gf24ba9de (mavsdk_impl.cpp:21)\r\n[08:23:30|Debug] Message debugging is on. (mavsdk_impl.cpp:32)\r\n[08:23:30|Info ] New system on: 127.0.0.1:24550 (with sysid: 0) (udp_connection.cpp:191)\r\n[08:23:30|Debug] New: System ID: 0 Comp ID: 0 (mavsdk_impl.cpp:544)\r\n[08:23:30|Debug] Discovered 0 component(s) (UUID: 0) (system_impl.cpp:511)\r\n[08:23:30|Debug] Sending message 4 from 1/195 (mavsdk_impl.cpp:247)\r\n[08:23:30|Info ] New system on: 127.0.0.1:37344 (with sysid: 1) (udp_connection.cpp:191)\r\n[08:23:30|Debug] Processing message 4 from 1/195 with seq 0 (mavsdk_impl.cpp:160)\r\n[08:23:30|Debug] New: System ID: 1 Comp ID: 195 (mavsdk_impl.cpp:544)\r\n[08:23:30|Debug] Component Unsupported component (195) added. (system_impl.cpp:354)\r\n[08:23:30|Debug] Sending message 4 from 245/190 (mavsdk_impl.cpp:247)\r\n[08:23:30|Debug] Processing message 4 from 245/190 with seq 1 (mavsdk_impl.cpp:160)\r\n[08:23:30|Debug] Component Unsupported component (190) added. (system_impl.cpp:354)\r\n[08:23:30|Debug] Sending message 0 from 1/195 (mavsdk_impl.cpp:247)\r\n[08:23:30|Debug] Processing message 0 from 1/195 with seq 0 (mavsdk_impl.cpp:160)\r\n[08:23:30|Debug] Discovered 1 component(s) (UUID: 0) (system_impl.cpp:511)\r\n[08:23:30|Debug] Sending message 0 from 245/190 (mavsdk_impl.cpp:247)\r\n[08:23:30|Debug] Processing message 0 from 245/190 with seq 1 (mavsdk_impl.cpp:160)\r\n[08:23:31|Debug] Sending message 110 from 245/190 (mavsdk_impl.cpp:247)\r\n[08:23:31|Debug] Processing message 110 from 245/190 with seq 0 (mavsdk_impl.cpp:160)\r\n[08:23:31|Info ] OPC:CMD_LIST_DIRECTORY (ftp_impl.cpp:811)\r\n[08:23:31|Debug] Sending message 110 from 1/195 (mavsdk_impl.cpp:247)\r\n[08:23:31|Debug] Sending message 0 from 1/195 (mavsdk_impl.cpp:247)\r\n[08:23:31|Debug] Processing message 110 from 1/195 with seq 1 (mavsdk_impl.cpp:160)\r\n[08:23:31|Debug] Sending message 110 from 245/190 (mavsdk_impl.cpp:247)\r\n[08:23:31|Debug] Processing message 0 from 1/195 with seq 2 (mavsdk_impl.cpp:160)\r\n[08:23:31|Debug] Processing message 110 from 245/190 with seq 2 (mavsdk_impl.cpp:160)\r\n[08:23:31|Info ] OPC:CMD_LIST_DIRECTORY (ftp_impl.cpp:811)\r\n[08:23:31|Debug] Sending message 110 from 1/195 (mavsdk_impl.cpp:247)\r\n[08:23:31|Debug] Processing message 110 from 1/195 with seq 3 (mavsdk_impl.cpp:160)\r\n[08:23:31|Debug] Sending message 110 from 245/190 (mavsdk_impl.cpp:247)\r\n[08:23:31|Debug] Processing message 110 from 245/190 with seq 4 (mavsdk_impl.cpp:160)\r\n[08:23:31|Info ] OPC:CMD_LIST_DIRECTORY (ftp_impl.cpp:811)\r\n```", "closed_by": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1467/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1467/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": "completed", "pinned_comment": null},